<title>USA: Tellabs Inc to supply system in Lebanon.</title>
<headline>Tellabs Inc to supply system in Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tellabs Inc said Monday it won an order to supply its Martis DXX managed access and transport network system to Libancell of Lebanon.</p>
<p>No value of the order was given.</p>
<p>The MartisDXX system will be deployed through Libancell's nationwide wireless network.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
